	optdepends = ydotool: Input automation tool for Wayland paste
	optdepends = ydotoold: Daemon for ydotool (auto-paste support)
	optdepends = xclip: Clipboard tool for KDE Wayland paste
	optdepends = xsel: Alternative clipboard tool for Wayland paste
	optdepends = wl-clipboard: Wayland clipboard utilities (wl-copy)
	optdepends = xdotool: X11 automation for paste simulation
	optdepends = wtype: Wayland input tool for wlroots compositors (Sway, etc.)
	optdepends = procps-ng: For pidof utility (process detection)
	optdepends = libpulse: For pactl (audio detection in meetings)
	optdepends = hyprland: For hyprctl (Hyprland shortcuts)
	optdepends = qt6-tools: For qdbus/qdbus6 (KDE shortcuts)
	optdepends = systemd: For journalctl (KDE integration)
